<title>USA: Port of Houston Auth., Texas won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Port of Houston Auth., Texas won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $28 million of Port of Houston Authority, Texas, port improvement bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.172 percent.</p>
</text>
